# Both players trespass on one guard at once (Remnants TrespassingCrime_15, Hadewin): the client's warning plays on its
# own screen, and the host walking in too gets its own, without the client's warning holding the guard still.

include session.coop
A run DayTime 12
B expect time contains "hour=12." timeout=15
sleep 5
B tpinto TrespassingCrime_15
B expect inside TrespassingCrime_15 contains "loaded=1" timeout=20
B expect actors 400 contains "NPC_Hadewin" timeout=40
B walk 0 0.2 0.5
B expect counter guardwitness >= 1 timeout=20
B expect dialogue contains "CrimeWarning" timeout=10
A tpinto TrespassingCrime_15
A expect inside TrespassingCrime_15 contains "loaded=1" timeout=20
A walk 0 0.2 1
A walk 0 -0.2 1
A expect dialogue contains "CrimeWarning" timeout=60
A expect counter leases == 0 timeout=1
A shot
B shot
